Arduino UNO R3 reference design — license and attribution
==========================================================

The design files in this folder (arduino_Uno_Rev3-02-TH.sch,
arduino_Uno_Rev3-02-TH.brd, Arduino_Uno_Rev3-schematic.pdf) are the
official Arduino UNO R3 reference design, published by Arduino.

Source:
  https://arduino.cc/en/uploads/Main/arduino_Uno_Rev3-02-TH.zip
  https://arduino.cc/en/uploads/Main/Arduino_Uno_Rev3-schematic.pdf

License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike (CC BY-SA),
as stated by Arduino for its hardware reference designs.
Copyright and trademark: Arduino.

This means: you may share and adapt the design if you give
appropriate credit to Arduino and distribute any adapted design
under the same CC BY-SA license.

The ai-pcb-design-skill itself is MIT licensed (see the LICENSE file
in the repository root). This folder keeps Arduino's own license:
the MIT license of the skill does NOT apply to these Arduino files.
